Surround yourself with a phantasmal shield of pure light.

Whenever you would take damage there is [13%, 16%, 19%, 21%, 22% (TL1-5; SP 100)] chance to become ethereal for an instant and fully ignore it.

If you do get hit, the shield glows brightly, sending triggering a flash of light on the attacker, dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage in radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] around it and dazzling any affected creature (deal 10% less damage) for 5 turns. This can only happen every [15, 13, 11, 10, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage and ignore chance will increase with your Spellpower.
